# Copy rules

Rules for user-facing text. `/compliance` and `/post-op` read this when a change touches copy. User-facing copy is
written in the language set as `UI_LANGUAGE` in `CLAUDE.md`. Delete each example row once you add real ones.

## Terminology

| Use | Never use | Why |
|---|---|---|
| member | user (in customer-facing text) | Example only: brand voice |

## Brand rules

- Example only: the product name is never translated or abbreviated.

## Verified claims

Every legal, regulatory or factual claim the product makes must appear here with its source. A claim not in this
table is blocked until it is verified and added.

| Claim | Source | Verified on |
|---|---|---|
| "Data is encrypted at rest" | Example only: hosting provider's security page | 2026-01-01 |
